    "detailed_description": "Co-op for 1-8 players<br>Embark on a thrilling cooperative adventures in SEKA II, a unique game that challenges you and your friends to become cunning mice on an epic quest for cheese! <br><br>Navigate through intricate labyrinths filled with twists, turns, and devious traps, all set by the mysterious EYE determined to test your wits and agility.<br><br>As you delve deeper into these cheese-infused mazes, you'll need to rely on teamwork and strategy to outsmart the EYE's experiments and evade its relentless pursuit. <br>Collaborate with your friends, forming a formidable pack of mice, to gather as much cheese as possible and uncover the secrets hidden within the labyrinth's walls.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Exciting co-op gameplay: Join forces with friends to explore, solve puzzles, and escape the gaze of the EYE<br></li><li>Dynamic labyrinths: Each maze is filled with surprises and challenges<br></li><li>Strategic teamwork: Coordinate with your pack to navigate obstacles, share loot, and outmaneuver the EYE's traps</li></ul><br>Gather your friends, embrace your inner mouse, and dive into the delightful chaos of SEKA II. <br>Will your pack emerge victorious, or will the EYE's experiments keep you trapped forever in its cheesy domain? <br>The adventure awaits!",
    "about_the_game": "Co-op for 1-8 players<br>Embark on a thrilling cooperative adventures in SEKA II, a unique game that challenges you and your friends to become cunning mice on an epic quest for cheese! <br><br>Navigate through intricate labyrinths filled with twists, turns, and devious traps, all set by the mysterious EYE determined to test your wits and agility.<br><br>As you delve deeper into these cheese-infused mazes, you'll need to rely on teamwork and strategy to outsmart the EYE's experiments and evade its relentless pursuit. <br>Collaborate with your friends, forming a formidable pack of mice, to gather as much cheese as possible and uncover the secrets hidden within the labyrinth's walls.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Exciting co-op gameplay: Join forces with friends to explore, solve puzzles, and escape the gaze of the EYE<br></li><li>Dynamic labyrinths: Each maze is filled with surprises and challenges<br></li><li>Strategic teamwork: Coordinate with your pack to navigate obstacles, share loot, and outmaneuver the EYE's traps</li></ul><br>Gather your friends, embrace your inner mouse, and dive into the delightful chaos of SEKA II. <br>Will your pack emerge victorious, or will the EYE's experiments keep you trapped forever in its cheesy domain? <br>The adventure awaits!",
    "short_description": "Lead a fearless team of mice through challenging test chambers! Dodge traps, battle foes, break barriers, collect cheese, and uncover the secrets behind the experiments. Join the mission now! Up to 8 players",
    "supported_languages": "English, Russian, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese",
